<title>USA: Microtest says suit filed against it.</title>
<headline>Microtest says suit filed against it.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Arizona 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Microtest Inc said on Friday that a class action lawsuit has been filed against it and certain of its directors and officers, alleging securities violations and common law fraud.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said that it believed the lawsuit was without merit and it intended to defend itself against the allegations &quot;vigorously&quot;.</p>
</text>
